{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act49side_level_act49side_07_beg","storyGroup":"act49side","storySort":14,"storyDependence":"act49side_level_act49side_06_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"TA-7","storyName":"相思断","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"记忆的迷宫中，二十年转瞬即逝。在执白者的搅弄下，望不得已孤身赴局。然而，岁陵之中，事情已出乎其所料。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act49side/level_act49side_07_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act49side_07","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":12,"next":14,"characters":["颉","椿","严肃的炎国官员","严肃的炎国官员？","耳目灵通的高官？","爱民如子的言官？","？？？","真龙","学识渊博的女性","禁军","望","朔"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1e/Avg_bg_70_g2_tjlibrary.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":7},{"type":"animtext","id":8,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_only_heavy","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>982年</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":9},{"type":"animtextclean","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":11},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":12},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_saferoom_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":13,"musicid":0},{"type":"subtitle","text":"二十年的时间，的确漫长。","x":"300","y":"320","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":14},{"type":"subtitle","text":"大炎将一整座城市搬上了移动平台，在许多遥远的地方，还有无数座这样的移动城市拔地而起。","x":"300","y":"320","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":15},{"type":"subtitle","text":"从各地收录的书卷很多，天镜阁在二十年中扩建了几番，已经是我完全认不出原貌的宏伟建筑。","x":"300","y":"320","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":16},{"type":"subtitle","text":"二十年的时间，也的确短暂。","x":"300","y":"320","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":17},{"type":"subtitle","text":"我们一家人聚少离多。","x":"300","y":"320","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":18},{"type":"subtitle","text":"大哥大姐依旧在戍边，二姐协助修订了《炎律》后正打算移住丹燕，黍长居大荒，绩游历四海，易遍访山川，年还是那样到处游戏。","x":"300","y":"320","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":19},{"type":"subtitle","text":"方弟据说已经出了大炎地界，小夕还是不肯从自己的画卷里出来，幺弟的饭店倒是红红火火，几十年如一日。","x":"300","y":"320","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":20},{"type":"subtitle","text":"至于二哥......","x":"300","y":"320","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":21},{"type":"subtitle","text":"他将自己锁在一间古寺里，为了精进“棋艺”，就这样枯坐了二十年......","x":"300","y":"320","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":22},{"type":"subtitle","text":"......他到底什么时候，才愿意与我再见一面呢？","x":"300","y":"320","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":23},{"type":"subtitle","id":24},{"type":"dialog","id":25},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":26},{"type":"dialog","id":27},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#9$1","duration":"1","id":28},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"......","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":31},{"type":"charslot","text":"m","id":32},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#1$2","duration":"0.5","id":33},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"颉，太史阁那边在催姜齐地方志的审校，不过——","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"偷闲被你捉住了。","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#3$2","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"......你偷闲也没问题的。那本地方志我校过一遍，有问题的地方都圈出来了。你还要再看一下吗？","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":40},{"type":"playsound","key":"$book_close","id":41},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#3$1","id":42},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"咦？真奇怪，这本书是什么时候......","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#13$2","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"唉......你得空还是多歇歇吧，人都要糊涂了。这些年，我几乎是看着你工作的时间一点一点增多，睡觉的时间一点一点变少......","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"各移动城市的地方志、建城史，上代真龙的实录，学宫古代史部分的教材......这么多书，我只是帮你整理，有时候都觉得累得慌。","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"真奇怪，我听说工部给年的委托越来越少，黍在大荒城的任务也没那么繁重了。","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"但好像唯独是你，身上的担子始终卸不下......","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#4$1","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"......","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#5$2","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"颉？","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/16/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#5$1","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"嗯......？","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"抱歉，刚刚有点走神了。","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"椿，今天的确是有点累了，我想先把这些工作放一放......","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#3$2","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"好呀。要不，我们去街上转转？","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#4$1","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"......不了。今天不知为何，有点心神不宁。你先去吧。","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"若是有什么有意思的东西，别忘了帮我也带一点。","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":65},{"type":"dialog","id":66},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":67},{"type":"charslot","id":68},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":69},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_bg_70_g1_tjoutside.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":70},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":71},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":72},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$suspenseful_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_suspenseful_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":73,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1632_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":74},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的炎国官员","text":"椿秉烛。","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1632_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#1$2","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"是我。您找我是......","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1632_1#1$1","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的炎国官员","text":"有封要紧的信带给您。","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1632_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#1$2","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"您......给我带信？谁寄来的？","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1632_1#1$1","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的炎国官员","text":"不知是谁给司岁台寄了封信，监正阅后大惊失色，将这封信转呈陛下，同时也抄送给各位直接接触代理人的秉烛人。","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1632_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#5$2","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"这里面是......？","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/16/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1632_1#1$1","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的炎国官员","text":"我也不知。监正只说让各位先做好准备，不要轻举妄动。","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1632_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":89},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","duration":"1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":90},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":91},{"type":"charslot","id":92},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#11$2","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"这里面说的是......","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/03/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":95},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper1","id":96},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":97},{"type":"sticker","id":98,"multi":"true","text":"■■年，出世。","x":"300","y":"220","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":99,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n■■年，与朔相搏，毁坏黎民生计无算。","x":"300","y":"270","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":100,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n......","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":101,"duration":"0.5"},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":102},{"type":"sticker","id":103,"multi":"true","text":"■■年，包庇同族，构陷官吏，使人蒙不白之冤。","x":"300","y":"220","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":104,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n■■年，躲避司岁台监视，与其余代理人私会。数月之后，司岁台失火，主犯成谜。","x":"300","y":"270","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":105,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n■■年，谎称诛杀矩兽，实则包庇，坐视其离开大炎。","x":"300","y":"270","alignment":"left","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":106,"multi":"true","text":"\\n\\n......","x":"300","y":"330","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":107,"duration":"0.5"},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":108},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#10$2","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"陷害官吏、私会、失火、包庇巨兽......","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"这说的是......","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3b/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#11$2","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"......望？","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/03/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"这真的是望做过的事？可为什么司岁台的记录没有这些？！","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/03/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":115},{"type":"charslot","id":116},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1632_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.6","id":117},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":118},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#5$2","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"你——你没走？！","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/16/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1632_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.6","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的炎国官员？","text":"另有一句话带给椿秉烛。","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1632_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的炎国官员？","text":"先诛大恶，再除元凶。","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1632_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":124},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","duration":"1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":125},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":126},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","id":127},{"type":"text","text":"更加惶恐的秉烛人快步走回天镜阁，与从天镜阁出门的朝官擦肩而过。","id":128},{"type":"dialog","id":129},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":130},{"type":"charslot","id":131},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":132},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_bg_70_g4_tjdiscussionroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":133},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":134},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":135},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1633_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.6","duration":"0.5","id":136},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1630_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.6","duration":"0.5","id":137},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":138},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳目灵通的高官？","text":"听说了吗，那个颉的事情？","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e7/Avg_avg_npc_1633_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"r","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱民如子的言官？","text":"听说了。颉乱修史书，天镜阁太史阁加起来没人能辖制得了她，长此以往，如何是好！","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_npc_1630_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"耳目灵通的高官？","text":"她的那个秉烛人也是失职。将来大炎历史一片混沌，她担得起这个责吗？","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e7/Avg_avg_npc_1633_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":145},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":146},{"type":"text","text":"秉烛人条件反射般转头看向那两个人的方向，只看见两个快步离开的影子。","id":147},{"type":"text","text":"她心神不宁，从架上拿起一本司岁台留下的卷宗。","id":148},{"type":"charslot","id":149},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#1$2","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"■■年，出世——","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#5$2","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"？！","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/16/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":154},{"type":"text","text":"秉烛人知道一定有什么不对，可她的眼睛却无法自制地跟着一行一行的字迹轮转。","id":155},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#5$2","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"■■年，把持天镜阁、太史阁。用心虽纯，却无人可以辖制。","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/16/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"■■年，真龙欲伐岁以除颉害，启岁陵，陵中空无一物。","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/16/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"■■年，废太史阁，修大炎文字，无人可以不遵。","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/16/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"■■年，察万民生计，其中凡有诈伪者，皆抹去姓名，流放边陲，死者千计——","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/16/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#8$2","id":161},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"这不是真的，这不是真的，她不是这样的人！","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a1/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":164},{"type":"text","text":"几个来看书的人好奇地看向这个秉烛人服色的家伙。椿擦了擦额头上的冷汗，再看向手里的书，却发现那不过是一本诗集。","id":165},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#13$2","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"我一定是魇住了。对的，她不是这样的人。","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"她永远都不会是这样的人吗？","id":169},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#8$2","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"她当然不是！","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a1/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":172},{"type":"text","text":"惊恐的秉烛人已经无暇分辨到底是谁在向自己搭话。","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"可当她的力量无限膨胀时，她也会变的。她会成为祂。","id":174},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#5$2","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"祂......？","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/16/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":177},{"type":"charslot","id":178},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#1$2","duration":"1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.6","id":179},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"可她不想成为祂。","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"她在向你求助，她不想变成那副模样。","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"大炎在向你求助，大炎不可接受这样的结局。","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"成为比岁兽本身，都更加强大、更加恐怖的力量，她没法不这么做。","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"你得帮她，只有你能帮助她......","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#5$2","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"可我......不能......","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/16/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#1$2","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.6","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"你会做出那个对所有人都好的选择的。","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":190},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2129_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.6","duration":"1","id":191},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":192},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":193},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":194},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":195},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2127_1#13$2","duration":"0.5","id":196},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"对所有人都好的......选择......？","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"椿","text":"等等，刚刚跟我搭话的究竟是谁？！","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d2/Avg_avg_npc_2127_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":200},{"type":"text","text":"只有那些话语的回响在她耳边轰鸣，久久不散。","id":201},{"type":"dialog","id":202},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":203},{"type":"dialog","id":204},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":205},{"type":"charslot","id":206},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":207},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rainlight_loop","loop":"true","channel":"r","volume":"0","id":208},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"r","fadetime":"2","id":209},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":210},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","id":211},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"陛下？","id":213},{"type":"dialog","id":214},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":215},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_bg_58_g5_dragonpalace.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":216},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":217},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":218},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loneliness_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":219,"musicid":2},{"type":"text","text":"年轻的官员缓步走入这座辉煌的宫殿，这是她第一次踏足此处。","id":220},{"type":"text","text":"那位九五至尊之人此刻却并不在皇位上，而是站在靠近窗边的位置，望着窗外连绵的雨幕。","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"......你应该知道，太师昨日去世了。","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"他是你的老师，也是我的老师。","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"他临终前向我举荐过你，说你是他最得意的学生，“可以重任相托”。","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"有些话，我来不及问他，便只好来问问你。","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"学识渊博的女性","text":"陛下请问，微臣恭听。","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"二十年前，太师曾经力阻我修建移动城市，说此为苛政。而作为人君，第一要务应当是“节用恤民”。","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"二十年来，有人说大炎边疆安稳，国库殷实，是千年未有之盛世。","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"有人说大炎宇内疲敝，民怨载道。","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"我想问你，在你看来，我做错了吗？","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"学识渊博的女性","text":"陛下，臣以为，我一人没有评判陛下的资格。","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"学识渊博的女性","text":"若我是安居于移动城市中衣食无忧的富贾，称颂陛下英明无双，这样的赞词能否算得上忠言？","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"学识渊博的女性","text":"若我是家人死于劳役的普通百姓，怒责陛下昏庸暴戾，政令一无是处，这样的批评又可算得上公正？","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"学识渊博的女性","text":"臣反而想询问陛下......","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"学识渊博的女性","text":"陛下真正在意的，到底是后世的评价，还是别的什么东西？","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"你倒是会说话。","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"好，那就不让你评判对错，你就代替你的老师，再给我一句谏言吧。","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"学识渊博的女性","text":"老师他曾说过一句话，臣自以为终身受用......","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"学识渊博的女性","text":"“世事诡随，谨致良知。”","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"学识渊博的女性","text":"寻常百姓的一生尚且难以在世事纷纭中寻得一个公正的评价，何况是陛下您？","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"学识渊博的女性","text":"这世上不存在可以评判陛下功过的法度，但陛下心中一定有衡量得失的良知。","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"谨致良知......","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"如果我心中的良知告诉我，我事事皆无过错，那又当如何？","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"学识渊博的女性","text":"那陛下今天，也不会召见我了。","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"学识渊博的女性","text":"只是想提醒陛下，炎国的百姓，他们不认识陛下，却能够看到陛下。","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"学识渊博的女性","text":"但陛下在这座禁城中，想要看清百姓，继而看清自己的得失，那就要多花一番功夫了。","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"......这番话，我也记下了。","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"如果我还有下一个二十年......我都会记着的。","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"太师对他的学生的评价，不为偏颇......明日起，先去礼部报道吧。","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"学识渊博的女性","text":"谢陛下。","id":250},{"type":"dialog","id":251},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":252},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":253},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":254},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":255},{"type":"text","text":"疲惫的真龙踱步回了皇位边，他的桌案上呈着一份罪状。","id":256},{"type":"text","text":"司岁台送来的罪状。","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"世事诡随，谨致良知......","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"生年不满百，常怀......千岁忧。","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"功过得失，自可交给后人评论......但大炎的顽疾，绝不可留待后世。","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"来人。","id":261},{"type":"dialog","id":262},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1634_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":263},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"禁军","text":"在。","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_1634_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"叫军队即刻就位。","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"......准备开启岁陵。","id":268},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":269},{"type":"dialog","id":270},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"r","fadetime":"2","id":271},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":272},{"type":"charslot","id":273},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":274},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/39/Avg_bg_bg_yanshabbyroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":275},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":276},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":277},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$storyendjp_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act5d0/m_avg_storyendjp_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":278,"musicid":3},{"type":"text","text":"又是一个漫长而疲惫的白天过去。","id":279},{"type":"text","text":"代理人回到那间熟悉的古寺，目光习惯性地投向角落里的棋枰，只是一瞥，他便敏锐地察觉到了某种异样。","id":280},{"type":"text","text":"这里有人来过。","id":281},{"type":"text","text":"他的棋枰上干干净净，只有正中央放着什么东西。光线晦暗，他看不大清。","id":282},{"type":"text","text":"他走上前去，才发现棋盘天元处，放着一枚白色的圆润饱满的银杏果。","id":283},{"type":"dialog","id":284},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","duration":"1","id":285},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":288},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":289},{"type":"charslot","id":290},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"0.7","block":"true","id":291},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_bg_58_g5_dragonpalace.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":292},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"你看庭中那株银杏，是今年春天刚种下的苗。","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"几天前，工部尚书在这里立下过军令状，在银杏树挂果之前，他定然让百灶改建为完整的移动城市。","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"二十年......我也给你二十年的时间。","id":296},{"type":"text","text":"......","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"近乎无限的寿命让你们傲慢，你们大概是忘了，寻常人一生，又能有几个二十年？","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真龙","text":"炎国等不起，我也不愿再等。","id":299},{"type":"dialog","id":300},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":301},{"type":"charslot","id":302},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","id":303},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":304},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/39/Avg_bg_bg_yanshabbyroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":305},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......何必催促？","id":307,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"我早有此意。","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":309},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":310},{"type":"charslot","id":311},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":312},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":313},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_bg_70_g6_suilingcorridor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":314},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":315},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":316},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.7","id":317},{"type":"dialog","id":318},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":319},{"type":"charslot","id":320},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#8$1","id":321},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"0.7","block":"true","id":322},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fb/Avg_bg_70_g11_oldpavilion.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":323},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"若你真计算出了一条行得通的路，那就告诉我，我情愿和你同去，胜算还大一些。","id":325,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"只要你告诉我，你究竟有几成胜算。我可以任你差遣，哪怕要我的命我也绝无怨言。","id":326,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"朔","text":"......可你知道自己在做什么吗？","id":327,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/81/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":328},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":329},{"type":"charslot","id":330},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":331},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_bg_70_g6_suilingcorridor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":332},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":333},{"type":"text","text":"这本是无解的死局。","id":334},{"type":"text","text":"分身如何战胜整体？“自己”如何能杀死“自己”而后幸存？","id":335},{"type":"text","text":"但是他看到了那唯一的出路，对他们所有人而言的出路。","id":336},{"type":"text","text":"由自己......取而代之。","id":337},{"type":"dialog","id":338},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.7","id":339},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":340},{"type":"charslot","id":341},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2125_1#1$1","id":342},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"0.7","block":"true","id":343},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_bg_bg_indoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":344},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"也许有朝一日，我们拥有的力量会超越祂，到那时，我们就能够摆脱祂的影响，真正作为“我们”而活着。","id":346,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"颉","text":"当然前提是，我们绝对不可以忘了自己是谁。","id":347,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2125_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":348},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":349},{"type":"charslot","id":350},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":351},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#1$2","focus":"n","id":352},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_bg_70_g6_suilingcorridor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":353},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":354},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":355},{"type":"text","text":"谋士早已做好了准备。","id":356},{"type":"text","text":"棋路谋算一道，他于这片大地上已无敌手——这是他锚定的自我，也是积蓄了千年的力量。","id":357},{"type":"text","text":"而他要面对的，不过只是一片沉寂许久的残破的意识。","id":358},{"type":"text","text":"这一局，无论如何输不得——","id":359},{"type":"dialog","id":360},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#11$2","id":361},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"......久违了。","id":362,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"傲慢的......无动于衷的......“我”。","id":363,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":364},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":365},{"type":"charslot","id":366},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ac/Avg_bg_70_g7_suilingcore.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":367},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":368},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":369},{"type":"text","text":"终于回到这座阔别千年的幽暗的墓室，过往的无数种情绪一一涌上心间。","id":370},{"type":"text","text":"愤怒，不甘，屈辱......","id":371},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1","id":372},{"type":"text","text":"当他真正踏足这里的瞬间，他突然感受到了一种深入骨髓的寒意。","id":373},{"type":"dialog","id":374},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_act31side_bat2_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act31side/m_act31side_bat2_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":375,"musicid":4},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2027_wang_1#6$2","duration":"0.5","id":376},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"望","text":"不......不对！","id":378,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f5/Avg_avg_2027_wang_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":379},{"type":"text","text":"这怎么可能？这绝无可能！","id":380},{"type":"text","text":"你......为何已经醒来？","id":381},{"type":"dialog","id":382},{"type":"charslot","id":383},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2129_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":384},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":385},{"type":"dialog","id":386},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":387},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":388},{"type":"bgeffect","id":389},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":390},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":391},{"type":"image","id":392},{"type":"charslot","text":"","id":393}],"characters":["颉","椿","严肃的炎国官员","严肃的炎国官员？","耳目灵通的高官？","爱民如子的言官？","？？？","真龙","学识渊博的女性","禁军","望","朔"]}